# Scacelith - Română (Romanian)
#
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals have three forms:
# one (1)|few (0, 2-19, 101-119...)|other (20-100, 120...: Romanian puts "de" before the noun, "20 de mutări").
# Register: the formal 2nd person plural of Windows / macOS in Romanian ("Introduceți parola"), without the
# subject pronoun, "dvs." for "your"; buttons are short nouns where one exists ("Anulare", "Aplicare").
# The player's gender is unknown: no adjective or passive participle agreeing with the player.
# Orthography: ș ț with the comma below (never the cedilla); quotation marks „…”; titles in capitals keep
# their diacritics.

